     "value": "Probable component of the PAM complex at least composed of a mitochondrial HSP70 protein, GRPEL1 or GRPEL2, TIMM44, TIMM16/PAM16 and TIMM14/DNAJC19 (By similarity). Interacts with DNAJC19. Directly interacts with DNAJC15; this interaction counteracts DNAJC15-dependent stimulation of HSPA9 ATPase activity. Associates with the TIM23 complex. Associates with the TIM23 complex (By similarity)"
